The generic page reader (`mibo/web/reader.js`, `read.py`,
`sites.py`) was written for this project; for an article's text it runs
Mozilla's Readability, vendored as listed below.
The official players it lets a card embed (`mibo/players.py`) are
each platform's own and load from that platform under its own terms.

Before it was named Mibo and numbered from 0.1.0, this code was published under
another name as versions up to 1.5.0: 1.4.0 and earlier under the MIT License,
1.4.1 to 1.5.0 under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0. Copies of those
versions stay under the licence they were released with.

